# Global, cross-project patterns only. Each subproject (web-app/,
# android-app/, desktop-app/) has its own .gitignore scoped to its own
# build-output paths — kept separate on purpose after a real bug was
# found here: a blanket "build/" pattern at this level was silently
# excluding desktop-app/build/icon.ico and icon.png, which are
# committed *source* resources (the packaging script points
# --icon=build/icon.ico at them), not build output. Do not re-add a
# bare "build/", "dist/", or "Output/" line here — put output-path
# ignores in the relevant subproject's own .gitignore instead, where
# they can be scoped precisely.
node_modules/

# Secrets — never commit real .env files, only .env.example
.env
.env.local
*.jks
*.keystore

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.iml
